@startuml DataFlow_v9
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
title Flujo de Datos v9.0 - Quantum Bio-Optimization

actor "Usuario" as User
participant "App / UI" as UI
participant "useEngineStore" as Store
participant "CalcEngine" as Calc
participant "Firestore" as DB

== Registro de Biometría Manual (Premium) ==
User -> UI : Ajusta SpO2 (+/-) o Estrés (Slider)
UI -> Store : updateManualSpO2(val) / updateStress(val)
Store -> DB : Sync Realtime Document
Store -> Store : recalculateAll()
Store -> Calc : calculateCI(biometrics, supplements)
Calc --> Store : CI Actualizado (v9 Logic)
Store --> UI : Feedback Visual (Glass UI)

== Consulta de Evidencia Científica ==
User -> UI : Click "Bibliografía Científica" en Perfil
UI -> UI : setActiveSubView('bibliography')
UI -> UI : Renderiza BibliographyView (APA 7)

== Accesibilidad Dinámica ==
User -> UI : Toggle Alto Contraste / Tamaño Aa
UI -> Store : setHighContrast() / setFontSize()
Store --> UI : Inyección de Clases CSS Globales
UI -> UI : Re-render con rem escalados

== Sincronización de Altura/SpO2 (Google Fit) ==
Store -> DB : fetch doc 'biometrics'
DB --> Store : { manualSpO2: 98, manualStress: 2 }
Store --> Calc : Prioriza manual sobre Fit API (Override)

@enduml

@enduml
